sequenceDiagram
    participant ODHOp as ODH Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FMO as feast-module-operator<br/>8081/TCP health, 8443/TCP metrics
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over ODHOp,K8sAPI: Flow 1: FeastOperator Reconciliation

    ODHOp->>K8sAPI: Create FeastOperator CR<br/>(default-feastoperator)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>FMO: Watch event: FeastOperator created

    FMO->>FMO: Initialize (resolve manifests path)
    FMO->>FMO: upgradeIfNeeded (semver gate)
    FMO->>FMO: setKustomizedParams (inject OIDC_ISSUER_URL)
    FMO->>FMO: releases (track component metadata)

    FMO->>K8sAPI: Read odh-feastoperator-config ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>FMO: Platform version data
    FMO->>FMO: reconcilePlatformVersion (handshake)

    FMO->>FMO: kustomize.Render (apply overlays)
    FMO->>FMO: migrateDeploymentSelector (if changed)

    FMO->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered resources<br/>(Deployment, CRD, RBAC, Services)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>FMO: Resources applied

    FMO->>FMO: deployments.Status (check health)
    FMO->>FMO: gc (garbage-collect stale resources)

    FMO->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator CR status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over Prom,FMO: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>FMO: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SAR
    FMO-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
